    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31100" root="عون" body-key="E">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَانَتْ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعُونُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْنٌ</span>, (S,
TA, [but see what follows,]) said of a woman,
<i>She was,</i> or <i>became, such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوَان</span>
[q. v.]; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوَّنَتْ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْوِينٌ</span>: (S, K:)
and in like manner, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عانت</span>, aor. as above, inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُؤُونٌ</span>, [or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْنٌ</span>, (Ham p. 630,)] is said of a cow,
accord. to AZ. (TA.)

